        "text": "Job data:\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\nRemote: {{ $json.workRemoteAllowed }}\nType: {{ $json.employmentType }}\n\nJob Description:\n{{ $json.descriptionText }}\n\nApply URL:\n{{ $json.apply_url }}\n\nTask:\n1. Identify the job category.\n2. Estimate how well the candidate matches this role.\n3. If match_score >= 50 then should_apply = \"Yes\", otherwise \"No\".\n4. Create a very short summary (2-3 sentences max) of the job description.\n5. Keep the response concise.\n6. In apply_url just use the link from the input. DO NOT make email by yourself.\n\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:\n{\n  \"title\": \"job title\",\n  \"company\": \"company name\",\n  \"apply_url\": \"job apply link\",\n  \"job_category\": \"AI / Data / Automation / DevOps / Software / Non-relevant\",\n  \"match_score\": 0,\n  \"should_apply\": \"Yes\",\n  \"short_summary\": \"short 2-3 sentence summary\",\n  \"reason\": \"short explanation\"\n}",
